Add on.
It should be noted that generally it is a good idea to sort out the sumti for 
various predicates in a tanru late in the disambiguation process.  That is, a 
tanru like (finpe je mirli kalte} does not require that there be sumti for 
{finpe je mirli}, ones for {finpe} and {morli} separately are enough.  The 
way the examples have been handled show that violating this guideline has not 
been nuch of a temptation, but it may be useful to have it explicit.
           
